  "fullDescription": "Immerse yourself in the nostalgic vibes of the 70’s with our Floral Bouquet SVG Design. Sized at 6000x4000Px, this captivating arrangement boasts a delightful fusion of retro and boho-chic elements. Bursting with charming wildflowers and vibrant daisies, this bouquet is undeniably reminiscent of enchanting summer meadows and rustic gardens.\n\nExquisitely hand-drawn and subtly infused with a hint of aesthetic allure, our design features a colorful flower bundle, an echo of a sunset-lit, spring bouquet. Drenched in bright hues, this design optimally complements card making endeavors or sublimation projects. Be it the rustic daisy, boho wildflower art, or an evocative wildflower arrangement – each element of the bouquet imparts a sense of timeless grace.\n\nThe design’s traditional floral art is perfectly balanced with the modern appeal of botanical illustrations. Offering touch of whimsy, the cottagecore flowers and wildflower line art add a dash of rustic charm. From junk journal flowers to retro botanical art and a traditional hand-painted bouquet, this design is a priceless addition to anybody’s graphic collection.\n\nWhether it’s a vintage botanical illustration, garden bouquet svg, or a splash of colorful daisy design that you seek, this versatile, visually compelling design truly delivers. The intricate and distinct features of the design embody a myriad of styles, further amplified by the nostalgic touch of 70s retro flowers.\n\nThis Floral Bouquet SVG Design weaves charm of the rustic wedding bouquet into the vibrancy of summer wildflower bundle and the delightful intrigue of a retro flower vector. Prepare to be enthralled by its captivating natural aesthetics. Remember, the beauty of this design lies not only in its versatility but also in the story it holds – a romantic journey through vibrant meadows and picturesque vintage gardens.",
